//! work on a resource's leased capacity and report what it consumed. The governed spine around
//! it -- admission through a provider binding, evidence, settlement of the lease -- is the
//! registry's (`host::allocation::work_under_lease`); providers live next to this contract
//! (the simulated one) or in `adapter` (`process_executor`, a real executor).

