//! A bounded, lossless record of untrusted source job assertions, not a native job transition.
//!
//! Independently authored from the public value contract inspected at Esellios
//! b72b2aa4a941c800eec4b990dba67eb9dca656e9 and 5acde1aa69b0fcbb327f2db02baf400ec3ff7afe.
//! No source implementation, currency table or fixture was copied. All nineteen job fields and
//! three trace fields retain their values; source times remain signed milliseconds. Empty IDs,
//! unusual Unicode and inconsistent source states are recorded without conferring validity.
//! Attempts are data, never an authenticated generation or a canonical revision.
//!
//! The enclosing admitted evidence record owns provenance, identity and access. This codec
//! grants no authority, claim, lease, retry, execution or completion. A provider's unknown outcome
//! remains separate from the source job state. Size limits bound this target capture domain;
//! refusal never truncates a source assertion or means that an effect did not happen.

