//!
//! Independently authored against the public value contracts in Mechatron
//! c43b8de6997d3f9857371aa8bdac4d18e0a72b79 (`substrate/runtime/src/chronica{,/wire}.rs`
//! and [storage](https://github.com/llgtrn/Mechatron/blob/c43b8de6997d3f9857371aa8bdac4d18e0a72b79/substrate/storage/src/lib.rs)). No source implementation was copied. The two supplied
//! fixtures are retained as explicitly authorized construction evidence with separate provenance.
//! Source hashes establish content consistency, not signer identity, authority or physical truth.
//! Source generations, clocks and identifiers remain source assertions. A successful local
//! verification of an Unknown source outcome does not resolve that outcome or permit a retry.

